# Jak 1: Triangle's look-around in first person (LIST-0.1.1 item 27). The game stops working out Jak's joints there
# (ja-channel-set! 0), and 0.1.0's body pose built on its own output each frame: his neck read back metres off and the
# view went 0.8 m ahead of him (sim b26 buttons1). Into play as jak1_buttons.sim, then Y (Triangle) into the
# look-around, the menu button (pause) and again, Y out of it, and a walk. Run with JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1
